{"3926370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dig Dig Spud Spud Harvest", "steam_appid": 3926370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live broadcasts are welcome!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Potato-Digging Harvest Game!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Dig-Dig, Spud-Spud!”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/extras/29eeb2a3a8d42d65caf2912aa459bc67.poster.avif?t=1756738441\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/extras/29eeb2a3a8d42d65caf2912aa459bc67.webm?t=1756738441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/extras/29eeb2a3a8d42d65caf2912aa459bc67.mp4?t=1756738441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvesting Tips</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig holes of all shapes and sizes to uncover a wide variety of potatoes!<br>But be careful—damaging a potato will lower your harvest rate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potatoes come in all sizes, so if you think you’re getting close, switch to digging by hand for a gentle touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the word <strong>“HARVEST”</strong> begins to glow, that’s your cue—harvest it immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Kinds of Potatoes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic <strong>sweet potato</strong> and <strong>regular potato</strong>,<br>to the lesser-known <strong>konjac root</strong> and <strong>cassava</strong>, the source of tapioca!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll also find fictional varieties like the <strong>Banana Potato</strong> and <strong>Mug Potato</strong>,<br>and the elusive <strong>Wild Yam (Jinenjo)</strong>, buried deep underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In total, there are <strong>10 unique types of potatoes</strong> to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll earn useful items as you dig:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Soft Touch</strong><br>Dig as hard as you want—your potato won’t take any damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Potato Search</strong><br>Makes the potato rise to the surface and stand out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Wireframe</strong><br>Reveals the exact soil area surrounding the potato.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live broadcasts are welcome!!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Potato-Digging Harvest Game!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“Dig-Dig, Spud-Spud!”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/extras/29eeb2a3a8d42d65caf2912aa459bc67.poster.avif?t=1756738441\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/extras/29eeb2a3a8d42d65caf2912aa459bc67.webm?t=1756738441\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/extras/29eeb2a3a8d42d65caf2912aa459bc67.mp4?t=1756738441\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvesting Tips</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig holes of all shapes and sizes to uncover a wide variety of potatoes!<br>But be careful—damaging a potato will lower your harvest rate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potatoes come in all sizes, so if you think you’re getting close, switch to digging by hand for a gentle touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the word <strong>“HARVEST”</strong> begins to glow, that’s your cue—harvest it immediately!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Kinds of Potatoes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the classic <strong>sweet potato</strong> and <strong>regular potato</strong>,<br>to the lesser-known <strong>konjac root</strong> and <strong>cassava</strong>, the source of tapioca!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll also find fictional varieties like the <strong>Banana Potato</strong> and <strong>Mug Potato</strong>,<br>and the elusive <strong>Wild Yam (Jinenjo)</strong>, buried deep underground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In total, there are <strong>10 unique types of potatoes</strong> to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Helpful Items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll earn useful items as you dig:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Soft Touch</strong><br>Dig as hard as you want—your potato won’t take any damage!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Potato Search</strong><br>Makes the potato rise to the surface and stand out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Wireframe</strong><br>Reveals the exact soil area surrounding the potato.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "“Dig-Dig, Spud-Spud!” Dig up the ground and harvest the potato without damaging it! Sounds simple, but it's surprisingly tricky.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/1728428c58f66cb409026a381d77d930cc9e85e8/header.jpg?t=1756738441", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/92880d9c7652794669e0163997d61729c174d4c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756738441", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3926370/92880d9c7652794669e0163997d61729c174d4c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756738441", "website": null